<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Configurar BotBot - VOD Premium</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=<%= Date.now() %>"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #0a0a0a;
            --bg-card: #141414;
            --accent-red: #e50914;
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #b3b3b3;
            --border: #2b2b2b;
        }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-main); color: var(--text-primary); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
        .container { background: var(--bg-card); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: center; max-width: 500px; width: 90%; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .form-group { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .form-group input { width: 100%; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .form-group input:focus { border-color: var(--accent-red); outline: none; }
        .btn-save { width: 100%; padding: 1rem; background: var(--accent-red); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .btn-save:hover { background: #b91c1c; }
        .btn-back { display: block; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-back:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .status-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .status-ready { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: #10b981; border: 1px solid #10b981; }
        .status-disconnected { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); color: #ef4444; border: 1px solid #ef4444; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-bottom: -20px; margin-top: -15px;">
            <button id="themeToggleBtn" style="background: transparent; border: none; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.15rem; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 35px; height: 35px; border-radius: 50%; transition: background 0.3s;" onclick="toggleTheme()" title="Alternar Tema">
                <i class="fas fa-sun" id="themeIcon" style="color: #f59e0b;"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div id="statusBadge" class="status-badge <%= appKey && authKey ? 'status-ready' : 'status-disconnected' %>">
            <%= appKey && authKey ? 'CONFIGURADO' : 'AGUARDANDO CHAVES' %>
        </div>
        <h2>Configuração BotBot API</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">Insira suas credenciais do BotBot.chat para ativar os disparos.</p>
        
        <form id="botbotForm">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>App Key (Identificador do Bot)</label>
                <input type="text" id="appKey" value="<%= appKey || '' %>" placeholder="Ex: <BOTBOT_APP_KEY>" required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Auth Key (Token de Autorização)</label>
                <input type="text" id="authKey" value="<%= authKey || '' %>" placeholder="Ex: <BOTBOT_AUTH_KEY>" required>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-save"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Salvar Credenciais</button>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 2rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Ações em Lote</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Reenviar aos revendedores o status dos últimos 50 pedidos avaliados (Aprovados/Rejeitados).</p>
            <button id="resendAllBtn" class="btn-save" style="background: #3b82f6;"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Reenviar Todas as Notificações</button>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 2rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Testar Conexão BotBot</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Envia "teste botbot" para verificar se o BotBot está funcionando.</p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <input type="text" id="testPhone" value="<TELEFONE>"
                    style="flex: 1; padding: 0.8rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                <button id="testBotBtn" class="btn-save" style="width: auto; padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem; background: #10b981; flex-shrink: 0;"><i class="fas fa-vial"></i> Testar</button>
            </div>
            <div id="testResult" style="display: none; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: left; word-break: break-all;"></div>
        </div>

        <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="btn-back"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Voltar ao Painel</a>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/admin-botbot.js?v=<%= Date.now() %>"></script>
</body>
</html>